{"v":3,"catch":"令人難忘的 FINAL FANTASY 傳奇，\n將這個奧妙無窮、色彩繽紛的世界，幻化成真。","desc":"最初於2016年10月發售，《WORLD OF FINAL FANTASY》的增強版本——《WORLD OF FINAL FANTASY MAXIMA》於Nintendo Switch隆重登場！許多被稱為「守護者」和「迷影獸」的歷代FF傳奇角色和怪物將會在這場有趣而刺激的冒險中登場。另外，在這個新版本中更配備了外觀變更系統，因此主角蓮恩和朗恩能夠使用各種不同守護者的外觀和技能來戰鬥。化身成歷代FF的傳奇角色，好好享受戰鬥的樂趣吧！","publisher":"SQUARE ENIX","release":"2025-12-04","genres":["角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 11.6GB / Switch 11.6GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/17fcd4050f4c1f65feeefcc7946f3f1481b67218575ae3ffc7e07cf2e200a9c3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4875001590ab538388e3dbdb6c86f219c2d4814dd6b670cdd28676a2c21213bb.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2f7c0de0c2a7a9213ad6d008b179103e2f4d6a7fd499a614898b92d147b49391.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6ada4289d304a9cc643f5b2b3c590e366fe87e6d2834b13d7154b0d3126deff1.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/273f8a2650406a33187617f7d03b3ea132f8cc1980e8a40e8a511a6c2aae3b94.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bbb28791bc80f251bfd06bfa01aea5d04467746052b231aceb30992e204c48dd.jpg"],"titleId":"010072000bd32000","dlc":[]}